- This has the same effect as explicitly adding WIP:/Draft: to the title

- GitLabDuo will be added automatically for new MRs if it is not Draft and --reviewers is not specified

- GitLabDuo will also be added to existing reviews when they are marked as ready if --reviewers is not specified

